Effective date: August 2, 2026

SiteLedger (Builder Costing) respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains what information the app collects, how it is used, and who it may be shared with. SiteLedger is operated by BBS ("we", "us").

1. Information We Collect
Unlike our other apps, SiteLedger requires an account so your data can be saved and synced across your devices. We collect:

- Account details: your name, email address, and (optionally) phone number, provided when you create an account.
- The data you enter: your projects, expenses, budgets, payments, notes, and any receipt photos you attach.
- Subscription status: whether you have an active Pro subscription. Purchases are processed by Google Play; we never see or store your card details.
- Basic technical data: limited diagnostic information needed to run the app reliably.

SiteLedger does not contain ads and does not use advertising identifiers.

2. Third-Party Services
SiteLedger uses the following third-party services, only as needed to operate the app:

- Supabase, our cloud database, authentication, and file storage provider, which hosts your account and the data you enter.
- RevenueCat, which manages your subscription status.
- Google Play Billing, which processes subscription payments.

These services process data according to their own privacy policies.

3. How Information Is Used
Information is used to:

- provide the app: save your projects and costs, calculate budgets and profit, and sync your data across your devices
- manage your subscription and unlock Pro features
- respond to your support requests
- keep the app running reliably

We do not use your data for advertising, and we do not sell it.

4. Payments and Subscriptions
SiteLedger offers an optional Pro subscription. Subscriptions are billed through your Google Play account. Payment details such as card numbers are handled entirely by Google - we do not receive or store them.

5. Data Storage and Security
Your data is stored with Supabase. Data is encrypted in transit (TLS/HTTPS), and access is restricted so that each account can only reach its own data. We take reasonable steps to protect your data, but no method of transmission or storage is completely secure.

6. Data Sharing
We do not sell your personal information, and we do not share it with advertisers. Data is shared only with the service providers listed above, as necessary to operate the app.

7. Data Retention and Deletion
We keep your data for as long as your account is active. You can ask us to delete your account and all associated data at any time by emailing contact@farelyt.com; we will action the request within 30 days.

8. Your Choices
You can view and edit your data in the app at any time, change your currency and account details, and request a copy or deletion of your data by contacting us.

9. Children's Privacy
SiteLedger is a professional tool for builders and contractors. It is not directed at children, and we do not knowingly collect data from anyone under 16.

10. Changes to This Policy
This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time. Any updates will be reflected by updating the effective date above.

11. Contact
If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, contact:
contact@farelyt.com
